{"4559930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Oboro no Ichi", "steam_appid": 4559930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/f3cc8721e0e684bbf7a8c41f5001af62.webp?t=1787482942\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[A Market Between Memories]</i><br><br>Welcome to <strong>Oboro no Ichi</strong>, a market suspended between memories, where lost souls seek peace.<br>Build, expand, and manage a spiritual market inspired by Japan, welcome wandering spirits, and shape a place that can grow alongside them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3779fd09bf0738aa97a2b18830939bed.poster.avif?t=1787482942\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3779fd09bf0738aa97a2b18830939bed.webm?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3779fd09bf0738aa97a2b18830939bed.mp4?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/0bdb26b443fac60546a941ee3460d3ea.webp?t=1787482942\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Build and Grow Your Market]</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely design your space, connecting stalls, buildings, and pathways to create a lively and harmonious place.<br>Each structure has a specific role: produce resources, supply your stalls, and grow your market one step at a time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3865dd11cbbf2bd25c49d98326fb74a4.poster.avif?t=1787482942\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3865dd11cbbf2bd25c49d98326fb74a4.webm?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3865dd11cbbf2bd25c49d98326fb74a4.mp4?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/83ed8c1553e0316e953b02b41f1f3b37.webp?t=1787482942\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A Simple Yet Deep Gameplay Loop)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right balance between beauty and functionality.<br>Organize production, manage sales, expand your market, and increase its appeal to welcome more and more spirits.<br>A relaxing cycle that is easy to grasp, yet full of choices, strategies, and combinations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/ca65e227f0c74fcb7c6d3d5ebd44665d.poster.avif?t=1787482942\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/ca65e227f0c74fcb7c6d3d5ebd44665d.webm?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/ca65e227f0c74fcb7c6d3d5ebd44665d.mp4?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/afa67213fc986f70384bd7ba9dd0846f.webp?t=1787482942\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(A Calm and Cozy Experience) </i><br><br>In <strong>Oboro no Ichi</strong>, there is no rush.<br>Only the slow drifting of spirits, the sound of the wind…<br>and a market that grows alongside them.<br>Take your time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/f49ffd6cfb080253e624f031c1f45ac3.poster.avif?t=1787482942\" width=800 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/f49ffd6cfb080253e624f031c1f45ac3.webm?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/f49ffd6cfb080253e624f031c1f45ac3.mp4?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/f3cc8721e0e684bbf7a8c41f5001af62.webp?t=1787482942\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[A Market Between Memories]</i><br><br>Welcome to <strong>Oboro no Ichi</strong>, a market suspended between memories, where lost souls seek peace.<br>Build, expand, and manage a spiritual market inspired by Japan, welcome wandering spirits, and shape a place that can grow alongside them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3779fd09bf0738aa97a2b18830939bed.poster.avif?t=1787482942\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4559930/extras/3779fd09bf0738aa97a2b18830939bed.webm?t=1787482942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite